{"id":12298,"date":"2025-04-06T13:32:37","date_gmt":"2025-04-06T13:32:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/meliponini.remyparis.com\/?p=12298"},"modified":"2025-08-22T14:34:42","modified_gmt":"2025-08-22T14:34:42","slug":"tetragonisca-desc","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/meliponini.remyparis.com\/tetragonisca-desc\/","title":{"rendered":"FAMILLE &#8211; Tetragonisca description"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"12298\" class=\"elementor elementor-12298\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-930d410 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"930d410\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-522362e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"522362e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Le genre\u00a0<strong>Tetragonisca<\/strong>, appartenant \u00e0 la tribu des Meliponini (abeilles sans dard, ou M\u00e9lipones), comprend que quatre esp\u00e8ces reconnues.<\/p><p>L\u2019esp\u00e8ce la plus connue de ce genre est <strong>Tetragonisca<\/strong> angustula, souvent appel\u00e9e abeja angelita et abeja de oro, abeille des anges ou encore abeille en or en fran\u00e7ais.<\/p><p><strong>Distribution\u00a0<\/strong>: Elle est tr\u00e8s r\u00e9pandue en Am\u00e9rique Latine, du Mexique jusqu\u2019au sud du Br\u00e9sil et nord de l\u2019Argentine.<br \/><strong>Taille\u00a0<\/strong>: Ce sont de tr\u00e8s petites abeilles, d&rsquo;environ 4 \u00e0 5 mm.<br \/><strong>Miel<\/strong>\u00a0: Leur miel est tr\u00e8s pris\u00e9 pour ses propri\u00e9t\u00e9s m\u00e9dicinales, son go\u00fbt floral et l\u00e9g\u00e8rement acidul\u00e9.<br \/><strong>Propolis\u00a0<\/strong>: Elles produisent \u00e9galement une propolis douce et riche en compos\u00e9s bioactifs.<br \/><strong>Cire\u00a0<\/strong>: Leur cire est fine et souple, poss\u00e8de une odeur subtilement florale, id\u00e9ale pour des bougies artisanales \u00e0 combustion lente, parfaites pour l\u2019aromath\u00e9rapie et la cosm\u00e9tique haut de gamme.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Le genre\u00a0Tetragonisca, appartenant \u00e0 la tribu des Meliponini (abeilles sans dard, ou M\u00e9lipones), comprend que quatre esp\u00e8ces reconnues. L\u2019esp\u00e8ce la plus connue de ce genre est Tetragonisca angustula, souvent appel\u00e9e abeja angelita et abeja de oro, abeille des anges ou encore abeille en or en fran\u00e7ais. Distribution\u00a0: Elle est tr\u00e8s r\u00e9pandue en Am\u00e9rique Latine, du [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[42,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-12298","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-famille","category-global"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/meliponini.remyparis.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/12298","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/meliponini.remyparis.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/meliponini.remyparis.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/meliponini.remyparis.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/meliponini.remyparis.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=12298"}],"version-history":[{"count":36,"href":"https:\/\/meliponini.remyparis.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/12298\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":21722,"href":"https:\/\/meliponini.remyparis.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/12298\/revisions\/21722"}]